Z||000008||kempo||10-11-2001||11:17 PM||||I've been on that game since day one.  I've got over a million cash, and my fastest car of the game, as yet, is the Formula 1 race car.  My fastest driveable car is the Pikes Peek Edition Escudo with well over 1500 HP and a hell of a lot of torque.  Hmm... first car I built up would be a regular Dodge Viper, which is currently faster than the Team Oreca Viper.  I know of a few tricks here and there.  One of the cooler things is watching Escudo pop a wheelie at 235mph.  My disappointments in the game are that there are NO Ferrari's and NO Fiero's.  Very sad.||||reg||1
