Z||000010||MinnGreenGT||10-12-2001||10:43 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Simple Fiero:<BR><B> Hey Minn what was your favorite car on GT1 and GT2?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I haven't been on GT1 in quite some time. But on GT2, I can kick butt with the Racing edition of the Mitsu FTO (not the LM edition, but the full racing model).  Favorite track for that car has to be the Seattle Circuit- just love the cornering on that car.<P>Otherwise, the Escudo Pike's Peak car is the fastest thing I've ever seen. It's got like 900+HP and can powerslide any corner on any surface. It's almost too fast.<P>I've always like the big high bank corners of the Red Rock Valley course... but I try to stay out of the "special" night course.  Ugh.<P>I can't wait to try out GT3... just going to have to rent the PS2 one of these weekends.  (Playstation games rock on my 36" Sony WEGA Trinitron TV  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">)||||reg||1
