Z||000021||ray b||10-13-2001||04:23 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GarethWright:<BR><B>Hey Ray B, I got that GPL Demo, totally fun, nothing like hitting the hay just right to tear off your wheels then redline the engine till it pops!  Also caught my car on fire once too, wheee!  Is there better than 640x480 graphics in the full version though?  Oh well, not bad for '98 I suppose   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>up date never stoped for gpl get the 1.2 patch/upgrade and the 1.4 cpu fix if your over 1.4 gig cpu and patch for vidio card glide for voodoo, d3d for GF cards all are on the same page as the demo<BR>gpl will go up to 2000-1600 if your machine will run that fast at 36 frames per sec look under opptions 3 screens<BR>in car set up screen drop fuel loads to 5 gal<BR>lite cars stop and go better than full up<BR>drive first lap slower to heat tyres then try harder but be very smooth press slowly on petals[if you have a wheel+petals] use 1/2 gas when braking<BR>do a web search there are 100s of glp sites with addons and tracks and set ups<BR>goood BB at [legends central forums]<BR>[hot grid] for links, [eagle woman]'s site for set ups for new drivers and advice<P><P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd||||reg||1
Z||000022||ray b||10-13-2001||04:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by ray b:<BR><B> [QUOTE]Originally posted by GarethWright:<BR>[b]Hey Ray B, I got that GPL Demo, totally fun, nothing like hitting the hay just right to tear off your wheels then redline the engine till it pops!  Also caught my car on fire once too, wheee!  Is there better than 640x480 graphics in the full version though?  Oh well, not bad for '98 I suppose    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>up date never stoped for gpl get the 1.2 patch/upgrade and the 1.4 cpu fix if your over 1.4 gig cpu and patch for vidio card glide for voodoo, d3d for GF cards all are on the same page as the demo<BR>gpl will go up to 2000-1600 if your machine will run that fast at 36 frames per sec look under opptions 3 screens<BR>in car set up screen drop fuel loads to 5 gal<BR>lite cars stop and go better than full up<BR>drive first lap slower to heat tyres then try harder but be very smooth press slowly on petals[if you have a wheel+petals] use 1/2 gas when braking<BR>do a web search there are 100s of gpl sites with addons and tracks and set ups<BR>goood BB at [legends central forums]http://www.legendscentral.com/cgi-bin/ultimatebb.cgi?ubb=forum&f=29&SUBMIT=Go<BR>[hot grid] <A HREF="http://www.noctua.f2s.com/links.htmlfor" TARGET=_blank>http://www.noctua.f2s.com/links.htmlfor</A>  links, [eagle woman]'s site <A HREF="http://eaglewoman.simracing.dk/for" TARGET=_blank>http://eaglewoman.simracing.dk/for</A>  set ups for new drivers and advice<P><P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd||||reg||1
