Z||000026||Nashco||10-14-2001||02:09 AM||||I keep hearing people say, "I heard the PS2 doesn't work well as a dvd player..."  Where is this coming from?  I do wish I had the dvd remote (not very expensive at all), but the quality is crystal clear, just like any standard dvd unit.  It's actually better than some dvd units because it's got a quick-access window you can screw around with the settings in while the movie is playing, so you don't have to go back to the main menu.<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
